%% EvaporChain — Tendermint Consensus State Machine (per height)

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NewHeight

    NewHeight --> Propose: round = 0<br/>start round timer
    Propose --> Prevote: proposer broadcasts Proposal<br/>OR timeout_propose

    Prevote --> Precommit: 2/3 stake prevotes for hash<br/>(check_prevote_quorum)
    Prevote --> Prevote: equivocating prevote<br/>→ slash 10% + reject (NOT counted)
    Prevote --> ViewChange: timeout_prevote<br/>without 2/3 quorum

    Precommit --> Commit: 2/3 stake precommits for hash<br/>aggregate BLS signatures
    Precommit --> ViewChange: timeout_precommit<br/>without 2/3 quorum
    Precommit --> Precommit: equivocating precommit<br/>→ slash 10% + reject

    Commit --> NewHeight: block finalized<br/>height++<br/>FinalityTracker records

    ViewChange --> Propose: round++<br/>timeout *= 2 (capped 6)<br/>new proposer
    ViewChange --> NewHeight: round ≥ MAX_ROUNDS_PER_HEIGHT (10)<br/>reset to 0

    NewHeight --> [*]: shutdown / state-sync trigger

    note right of Prevote
        locked_block / locked_round
        prevent fork choice
        ambiguity across rounds
    end note

    note right of Commit
        on_block_finalized:
        - records.insert(h, ...)
        - latest_finalized = max(latest, h)
        - DA attestation round fires
    end note
